  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simayan-dai:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayan-dai:p001:m0000" ref="9ca_6ue_hy2">代哀王演</persName>，字宏度，太康十年受封。少有廢疾，不之國，演常止于宮中。薨，無子，以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayan-dai:p001:m0038" ref="x4m_ygm_1d3">成都王穎</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayan-dai:p001:m0043" ref="t70_9a6_8w3">廓</persName>為嗣，改封中都王，後與穎俱死。</p>
</text>
